          "description": "Casting Intro Skill - Yo, It's Big Boomin' Time!, Intro Skill - Hey, Leadhead, Come 'n' Get Me!, or Resonance Liberation - Party 'til Dawn! grants 20% All-Attribute DMG Bonus for all Resonators in the team for 30s.\nWhen Resonators in the team inflict Hack - Shifting, they gain 15% All DMG Amplification for 30s.\nHot Hand regenerates twice as fast when Rebecca is out of combat.",
