          "key": "1510:sequence:1:0",
          "name": "Gold Kindled in Ash",
          "description": "Luuk Herssen gains 150% Mid-air Attack DMG Bonus.\nThe max stack limit of Dawnlit Keep is increased by 1.\nWhen in the Aureate Judge state, casting Resonance Skill Aureole of Execution grants 1 of Dawnlit Keep.",
