          "name": "A Dagger to Cut Clean Obsessions",
          "description": "Echo Skill DMG is Amplified by 80%.\nCasting Scarlet Coda will convert all Volatile Notes to Volatile Notes - Cadenza in turn. Targets hit by Enhanced Attack - Hecate: Cadenza will have their ATK reduced by 20% for 15s.",
